                                                "sense_id": "07d33ab9-d65a-3254-8546-4d744eab507e",
                                                "text": "And on the end of the big table sat a pot of chicken and dumplings, the sad but tasty end of a tough red bird who had competently done his roosterly duty all his life, yet through no fault of his own had ended up a criminal."
                                            }
                                        ]
