                                                "sense_id": "a4819cb6-a33e-3aaa-88e6-2bd46dc110be",
                                                "text": "On Sundays he mounted the pulpit instead of black bare bones, and as a preacher he drew the fangs of Satan with his spiritual pullikins, almost as skillfully as he did the teeth of his brother sinners on week days, with his metallic ones."
                                            }
                                        ]
